[options]
[A.]
<$Playsound,whirligigFire-1000.wav>

     <h2>Slave to the King (Bombing of Sun City)<a href="#mission10">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                               ~[IsunFactory.12]
<br>                                                                                  ~1~y<?!{sw_difficulty1}>HARD</?><?{sw_difficulty1}>EASY</?>~.<br>

<i>Kill them all and let Hades sort them out.<br>
                                  ---Haggert the Warrior of Hades</i>
<p>
You must now travel to Sun City. Your mission is to bomb them from the sky first and then take no prisoners.
<p>
             <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                          <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                             <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>             <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Onward</a>                <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">I gotta go now</a>
$OnExit= ,Playsound,golemMove1.wav
<$Tell,sound1>
$Button= ,Tell,A.

