[ai4PriestDead]
Hehe. You bow down and thank<br>
{sw_hades} for his generous gift...
<p>
~I"This isn't so bad"~., you think to yourself.
<$ChangeMoney,5000>

[ai5PriestCaptured]
<i>"Kill that traitorous feind!"</i>
<p>
~I"Is that you Lord Hades?"~., you ask.
<p>
<i>"Kill him now!"</i>
 <p>
~I"Yes my Lord. Immediately my Lord."~.
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[ai5PriestDead]
You recieve a gift from your Master:<br>
             Storm Crystals
<$ChangeMoney,1500>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[ai3TempleHalfDead]
Haggert, the Warrior of<br>
{sw_hades} send you an urgent message:
<br>
<i>"Ally, I'm losing your war."<br>
                      --Haggert</i>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[ai3TempleDead]
Haggert, the Warrior of {sw_hades} calls out to you.
 With panic in his voice, he yells:<br>
<p>
<h2><i>"I beg you! Save me now. For I do not want to go down to Hades again!"</i></h2>
$Button=I'll try,DoNothing,0


[ai3PriestCaptured]
Haggert, the Warrior of {sw_hades}, and your ally, yells to you.
His voice trembles with hysteria as he screams:
<h2><i>"Hurry!"</i></h2>
<i>"For Hades promised to set my soul free if I return victorious."</i>
$Button=I'll try,DoNothing,0


[ai3PriestDead]
Another one of {sw_hades} Henchman just bit the dust. Don't fret,
for his soul you will see again.
<p>
For that is one of the tortures that King {sw_hades} has put unto this
poor wretched creature: He will constantly go through the torture of
sacrifice, throughout eternity (or until his soul is put to rest by someone
defeating {sw_hades})
<p>
But you have no time for contemplation. You must fight on!
$Button=Poor wretched soul,DoNothing,0


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>WHOHOO!</h2>
You've won another battle for your almighty Fury!
<p>
The {sw_god5} speaks to you:<br>
<i>"Groveler, I grow tired of you incompetence. I don't know why I let you
 live. You're taking far too long to bring me souls. If you don't bring me souls
 quicker next time, I will wish you had been sacrificed!"
<p>
"Now get out of my sight, you putrid pack of pus, and get me what I want!"</i>
<p>
~IWhat gratitude~., you think to yourself. ~IWell, at least he
 didn't torture me... He must be starting to take a liking to me!~.
